         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nIn the Yupana, numbers are represented like the Quipus: they grow **upwards**, row by row, instead of spreading out to the left as we add more digits.\n\nIn this class, we will see how to represent large numbers with the Yupana.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
