         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Keeping the Pattern\n\nLike us and like the quipus, the Yupana also grows numbers in the vertical direction.\n\nIn this class, we use the **Yupana Inka Tawa Pukllay** method, developed and published by Dhavit Prem, to populate the Yupana.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
