         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nWe do not have to stop at two rows. We could keep adding more rows and represent even larger numbers with the Yupana — but for now, we will stop here.\n\nIn this class, we learned how to write numbers with the Yupana and how this way of counting is connected to our body.",
               "source": null,
